# C7 cluster 12 (docs/plans/c7_leaf_system.md): the leaf system's render lists at fixed poses, the
# witness two builds are compared by. L1 recorded stock's and managed's lists A/B in one process
# (cs_cl_leaf_lists); since L2 the registry and every decision are managed's and there is one path, so
# the comparison is across builds: run this at each and compare the traces' `scenebytes` lines (every
# world view's list as it was built). Two frames at the first pose measure the frame-to-frame noise;
# the map is then loaded again in the same process and the first pose recorded once more (the second
# map load). Every build carries the recorder:
#   INSTANCE=0 tools/probes/c0-session OUT tools/probes/sessions/c7-leaf-ab.steps --no-probe-build
wait managed client module initialized 120
cmd map dm_lockdown
wait first paint 240
sleep 2
cmd sv_cheats 1
api teleport pos=-4116,4600,3 ang=0,-90,0 settle=1
sleep 2
cmd cs_cl_render_trace {out}/pose1-a.txt
wait recorded \d+ lines to .*pose1-a 20
cmd cs_cl_render_trace {out}/pose1-b.txt
wait recorded \d+ lines to .*pose1-b 20
api teleport pos=-3843,2894,0 ang=25,90,0 settle=1
sleep 2
cmd cs_cl_render_trace {out}/pose2.txt
wait recorded \d+ lines to .*pose2 20
api teleport pos=-3800,2500,0 ang=-20,30,0 settle=1
sleep 2
cmd cs_cl_render_trace {out}/pose3.txt
wait recorded \d+ lines to .*pose3 20
cmd map dm_lockdown
sleep 25
cmd sv_cheats 1
api teleport pos=-4116,4600,3 ang=0,-90,0 settle=1
sleep 2
cmd cs_cl_render_trace {out}/reload-pose1.txt
wait recorded \d+ lines to .*reload-pose1 60
quit
